# Contact form delivery.
#
# You normally do NOT need this file. The form posts to /send.php on the same
# origin, which sends through the domain's own mailbox over authenticated SMTP.
# Its credentials live in mail-config.php ON THE SERVER, never here and never in
# the bundle - see mail-config.example.php.
#
# Both variables below are optional overrides. Copy this file to .env only if
# you want one of them.

# Override 1: use web3forms.com instead of /send.php. Takes priority over
# everything else if set. Note the key ships inside the public JS bundle.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Override 2: point the form at a different URL that accepts a JSON POST -
# Formspree, a serverless function, or send.php at a non-default path.
# Ignored if VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY is set. Defaults to /send.php when empty.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=

# NEVER put SMTP or mailbox credentials in a VITE_* variable. Vite inlines them
# into the JS at build time, so anything here is readable by any visitor.
